			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1858,
				5
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Rewrite rustdoc comments to meet quality standards\n\nReplace meta-instructional doc text (\"This struct does X\" → \"X\", \"Represents Y\" → \"Y\"), remove empty and blank doc-comment lines, and convert TODO-section module stubs into proper //! module documentation with structured lists.\n\nChanges:\n- `MountainEnvironment.rs`: Condensed struct-level doc to remove \"Primary dependency injection container\" preamble in favour of a direct description.\n- `CocoonService/mod.rs`: Promoted stale \"thin-wrapper dispatcher\" ASCII comment to proper //! module doc with formatted item list; rewrote struct- and field-level docs to drop \"This struct\" / \"Provides\" meta-text.\n- `RPC/mod.rs`: Expanded module doc to a formatted //! block.\n- `rewrite_docs.py`, `fix_rustdocs.py`: Added automation scripts for ongoing rustdoc quality enforcement across the IPC and core modules.",
			"SHA": "725b11e0cfe12294c5830848c3cd74d0efa0d32f"
		},
